OL,5,G0415 Find It, Fix It, Flog It          
OL,6,     FOn the south coast, Henry Cole    
OL,7,     Fgets to work an aircraft fuel     
OL,8,     Ftank, while Simon O'Brien becomes 
OL,9,     Fobsessed with a 1960s speedboat.  
OL,10,G0500 Find It, Fix It, Flog It          
OL,11,     FSimon O'Brien repurposes an old   
OL,12,     Fbutcher's block into a coffee     
OL,13,     Ftable, while Henry Cole restores a
OL,14,     Fpair of go-karts to race against  
OL,15,     Frestorer Guy.                     
